      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Trade Marks Act 1995 (Cth)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Trade Marks Regulations 1995 (Cth)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Act and Regulations prescribe which documents and data must be publicly available."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "This Manual Part outlines the steps that enable documents and data to be stored in a form that can be accessed electronically on the trade marks database. This is termed \"Data Capture\"."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "This Manual Part also outlines the steps by which trade marks are made searchable on the trade marks database. This process is termed \"Indexing”."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "There is also an outline of the capture and indexing process for regulated signs."
        }
      ],
